  "statuteText": "671:8 Composition of Cooperative School Boards. –\n\nThe number, composition, method of selection, and terms of members of cooperative school boards shall be as provided in the bylaws or articles of agreement of the cooperative school district, as the case may be, in accordance with RSA 195:19-a."
